  "body": "Delivering an exceptional combination of scale, versatility and contemporary comfort, this outstanding residence offers approximately 258sqm of thoughtfully designed living on an approximately 503sqm section. Set in an elevated position, the home captures sea views, offering a stunning coastal backdrop from day to day. Perfectly suited to large or multi-generational families, every space has been carefully considered to provide flexibility, privacy and effortless everyday living. Complete with the reassurance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this is a home designed to be enjoyed for years to come.\r\n\r\nThe ground level has been intelligently configured to accommodate independent living, featuring an excellent two-bedroom granny potential with its own living area and bathroom. Whether accommodating extended family, teenagers, long-term guests or creating a private retreat, this versatile space offers endless possibilities.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is dedicated to everyday family living, where an expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home. Flooded with natural light, the space creates a warm and inviting atmosphere while effortlessly connecting family and entertaining zones. The beautifully appointed kitchen showcases clean architectural lines, premium appliances, and a generous island bench that serves as both a practical workspace and a natural gathering point for casual dining and conversation. A well-appointed walk-in pantry further enhances storage and functionality, ensuring the space is as efficient as it is elegant.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors create a seamless connection between the main living area and an expansive kwila deck, extending effortlessly into a beautifully landscaped garden, ideal for entertaining, quiet relaxation, or enjoying the changing seasons. The landscaped garden enjoys a peaceful outlook, facing the reserve for added privacy and a natural green backdrop.\r\n\r\nThe master suite enjoys the privacy of its own ensuite and spacious walk-in wardrobe, creating a relaxing retreat at the end of the day. Three further well-proportioned bedrooms are serviced by a stylish family bathroom with a bathtub. Adding even more practicality, a thoughtfully positioned study nook creates the perfect work-from-home station, children's homework area or reading corner.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features Include:\r\n-A heat pump in granny potential, ensuring comfort throughout every season. \r\n-Central air-conditioning system\r\n-Sound system\r\n-Double internal-access garage with laundry nook\r\n-Intercom\r\n-A convenient under-stairs storage, offering practical and efficient additional storage space\r\n\r\nLocated in the highly sought-after Millwater community, close to quality schools, parks, motorway links, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, and Orewa Beach, this home brings together space, functionality, and lifestyle in one of the area's most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nOffering remarkable flexibility, premium finishes and beautifully proportioned living spaces, this exceptional home has been thoughtfully crafted to accommodate every stage of family life while providing the luxury and comfort expected of a modern residence.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
